{"id":17933,"name":"Talladega County","slug":"talladega-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/talladega-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:23","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","bidProcedure":"Bid Down","redemptionPeriod":"3 years (valid up to 10 years)","interestRate":"12%","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"May"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Revenue Commission"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"GovEase"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Talladega County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"FLfCzTbeD\"><iframe title=\"Earn More and Discover 12% Yearly Gains!\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2TwhL7nrJgg?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Earn-More:-Discover-12%-Yearly-Gains---Talladega-County,-Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">Earn More: Discover 12% Yearly Gains &#8211; Talladega County, Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Ready to see your investment grow with a guaranteed 12% interest?</strong> Talladega County, Alabama, hosts its Tax Lien Sale online every May. Jump into the auction from the comfort of your home via the <a href=\"https://govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a> website, where all the action happens.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien investing can be a great way to earn higher returns than traditional investments. The initial cost of acquiring properties through tax liens or tax deeds is relatively low, making it an attractive option for investors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Lien-Certificates\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When you purchase a tax lien certificate, you&#8217;re not buying the property itself. Instead, you&#8217;re buying the debt on the property, which allows you to collect back taxes plus interest. In Talladega County, the interest rate on these certificates is a robust 12%. If the property owner fails to pay their taxes, you can foreclose on the property and potentially become its new owner.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Lien-Investing\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"1.-Research-and-Understand-Local-Laws\">1. Research and Understand Local Laws</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Understanding the legal framework is crucial. Each area has specific regulations governing tax lien sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"2.-Visit-the-Local-Treasurer's-Website\">2. Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>For Talladega County, Visit the <a href=\"https://www.talladegacountyal.org/departments/revenue_commission_-_new/property/tax_sale.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Revenue Commissioner&#8217;s website</mark></a> for all the necessary information.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"3.-Check-the-Auction-Site\">3. Check the Auction Site</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The auction is conducted on <a href=\"https://govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a>​, where you can register and participate in the sale.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"4.-Read-the-Details-About-Tax-Liens\">4. Read the Details About Tax Liens</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Ensure you understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiries, and other essential details. Registration for the auction begins in April, and it&#8217;s free​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"5.-Contact-the-County-Office\">5. Contact the County Office</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have any questions, you can reach the Talladega County Revenue Office at 256-761-2123​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Talladega-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17945 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Talladega County Courthouse Alabama\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Online-Tax-Lien-Sale\">Online Tax Lien Sale</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The Talladega County Tax Lien Sale for delinquent tax properties will begin on May, from 9:00 AM to 4:30 PM and continue until all properties are sold. Registration begins in April, and training webinars are available to help you prepare​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Always research the property thoroughly before bidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Verify the property size, location, dimensions, and value.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understand the chain of title to check for any claims, judgments, or liens that could affect the property&#8217;s value​​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner redeems the lien?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: If the property owner redeems the lien, you will be reimbursed the amount you paid plus the interest rate you bid on at the auction.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I register for the auction?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Registration is free and begins in April. Visit <a href=\"https://govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a> for more details.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What payment methods are accepted for property tax payments?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: After March 31, payments are accepted via cash, cashier&#8217;s check, money order, or card​.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.talladegacountyal.org/departments/revenue_commission_-_new/property/tax_sale.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Talladega County Tax Lien Information</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">​</mark></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.talladegacountyal.org/government/revenue_commission.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Talladega County Revenue Commissioner</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">​</mark></li